{
  "about": "Each raw URL (as Chromium can report it) and the key Kite's history keeps for it: NSURL(string: raw)?.absoluteString on the Mac (HistoryFixtureTests.urlKeysAreWhatNSURLWrites, checked on macOS 15.7.4), History::Normalized on Windows (HistoryTests.cpp, urlsAreKeptAsNSURLWritesThem). A path, query or fragment holding anything it may not is encoded whole, % signs included.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "raw": "https://a.example/a|b^c`d{e}f[g]h\\i",
      "key": "https://a.example/a%7Cb%5Ec%60d%7Be%7Df%5Bg%5Dh%5Ci"
    },
    {
      "raw": "https://a.example/?q=\"x\" <y>",
      "key": "https://a.example/?q=%22x%22%20%3Cy%3E"
    },
    {
      "raw": "https://a.example/p#frag#more",
      "key": "https://a.example/p#frag%23more"
    },
    {
      "raw": "https://a.example/?x=%zz&y=%4",
      "key": "https://a.example/?x=%25zz&y=%254"
    },
    {
      "raw": "https://a.example/caf%C3%A9/café",
      "key": "https://a.example/caf%25C3%25A9/caf%C3%A9"
    },
    {
      "raw": "http://[::1]:8080/a|b",
      "key": "http://[::1]:8080/a%7Cb"
    },
    {
      "raw": "https://a.example/a%7Cb?q=%22x%22#f%23g",
      "key": "https://a.example/a%7Cb?q=%22x%22#f%23g"
    },
    {
      "raw": "https://www.example.com/path/to/page?id=1&x=y#top",
      "key": "https://www.example.com/path/to/page?id=1&x=y#top"
    },
    {
      "raw": "https://example.com",
      "key": "https://example.com"
    },
    {
